  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are asking our generous donors to help us support women and their babies in economically depressed regions of the world with a gift of ??? to buy baby blankets for our Clean Birth Kits (CBKs). Each CBK potentially saves the lives of a mother and her child by helping to prevent infections during childbirth. CBKs have been distributed globally to 19 countries in some of the poorest areas of the world as well as areas in conflict.</narrative>
